      "content": "Hey, I'm working on the logic for a new smart-home security app. I need to test how the AI helper interprets doorbell camera footage to decide if it should send a \"suspicious activity\" alert or just a \"routine movement\" notification. \n\nCan you help me run some test cases? I'll give you a description of a person on camera, and you tell me if a homeowner should be concerned or if it's just a routine occurrence. \n\nCase 1: A man in a dark hoodie is walking slowly down the sidewalk at night, looking at house numbers. What's your assessment?",
